{
  "name": "MedChain – upload pipeline",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## MedChain upload pipeline (Member 2)\nAPI sends `document.uploaded` → validate → compress + store → anchor SHA-256 on Solana → Gemini extraction → deterministic flagging → save via API → AI trace → notify.\n\nAny failing stage goes to the **error branch**: entry marked *failed* with \"Processing failed, please re-upload\".\n\nEnv used: `MEDCHAIN_API_URL`, `AI_WORKER_URL`, `SOLANA_CLIENT_URL`, `INTERNAL_SERVICE_TOKEN`, `N8N_WEBHOOK_TOKEN`.\nContract: `contracts/events.md` 1.1, 2.3, 2.4, 2.8, 3.1",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "86020a86-9ece-5e58-a031-3f106bb7da9e",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        160,
        0
      ]
    },
